  "title": "Howmet Aerospace to Host Technology and Markets Day on March 10, 2026",
  "summary": "PITTSBURGH, Feb. 6, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Howmet Aerospace Inc. (NYSE: HWM) announced today that it will host a Technology and Markets Day investor presentation on Tuesday, March 10, 2026, 8:00 AM to 10:30 AM ET. A detailed agenda and live webcast of the event will be available in the “Events and Presentations” section of howmet.com/investors. […]",
